      "text": "the Lamb should take away sins of world, 1 Ne. 10:10. plain and precious parts of gospel are taken away, 1 Ne. 13:26–29, 40. the Lord commands that men should not take his name in vain, 2 Ne. 26:32 (Mosiah 13:15; Ex. 20:7). take upon you name of Christ, 2 Ne. 31:13 (Mosiah 5:8, 10; Alma 34:38; 46:18, 21; 3 Ne. 27:6; Morm. 8:38; Moro. 4:3). Christ to take upon himself image of man, take upon himself flesh and blood, Mosiah 7:27 (Ether 3:9, 16). the Son shall take upon himself transgressions of those who believe, Alma 11:40 (34:8).",
